Moderately minor spoilers...


































You have intrinsic warning.  You can get this multiple ways, including
reaching a certain level in certain character classes, weilding Sting,
carrying some of the Quest artifacts, and possibly some others.

Whenever some monster nearby might pose a threat, you will sense a
colored flash. The color depends on just how much of a threat the
monster is.  I don't know the exact ranking, but the darker the color,
the more dangerous the monster.  Pink should be no real problem.  Ruby
means a tough monster.  Black means run like hell.  (I think the
statistic comes from comparing your level to the monster level;  I
could be wrong about this).




